470	## 3. ERROR HANDLING ISSUES
471	
472	**Current Status:** Generic error handling with potential information disclosure
473	
474	**Risk:**
475	```
476	Stack traces exposed to users
477	Internal system details revealed
478	Helps attackers identify vulnerabilities
479	```
480	
481	**Solution:**
482	```javascript
483	// ✅ Generic error handling
484	app.use((err, req, res, next) => {
485	  logger.error('Unhandled error', { error: err.message, stack: err.stack });
486	  
487	  // Don't expose internal details to clients
488	  const statusCode = err.statusCode || 500;
489	  const message = statusCode === 500 ? 'Internal Server Error' : err.message;
490	  
491	  res.status(statusCode).json({ error: message });
492	});
493	
494	// ✅ Handle 404 errors
495	app.use((req, res) => {
496	  res.status(404).json({ error: 'Not found' });
497	});
498	```
